WEBVTT

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.820
<b>Kurotama Bath</b>

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.910
Ah, it's great being first in the bath.

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:21.670
Atsushi, you know, there's something 
I've been thinking about lately.

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:24.720
What is it, En-chan? 
The tax increase? The Olympics?

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.160
No, chikuwabu.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:27.630
Chikuwabu?

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:29.590
He's a real mystery, you know?

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:32.260
It's just chikuwabu...

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:35.570
Not quite chikuwa, not quite fu.

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:37.820
He doesn't exist outside of oden.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:39.560
Why is he even alive?

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:40.990
Well, it's not alive...

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:45.300
He's excluded from both the paste products 
group and the wheat gluten group.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.290
When I think about how he must feel, 
it's kind of depressing.

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:51.020
But there are people who like chikuwabu.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.500
Oh? You like chikuwabu?

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.990
Gonna start a club? A chikuwabu-bu?

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.950
What? Chikuwabu-bu is too hard to say.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.410
It's the wabu-bu who plot 
to dominate via chikuwabu.

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:03.370
You're abbreviating it...

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:08.290
Daikon radish and tofu fritters 
contribute to the diversity that is oden

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:11.250
by creating a savory flavor.

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:14.280
Yet chikuwabu only absorbs that savoriness,

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:15.850
offering nothing of its own.

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:17.310
Couldn't you say the same of konjac?

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.390
No, konjac is at least flexible.

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:24.830
It's broad-minded enough to absorb that 
savoriness into its deepest parts.

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:28.960
Yet, with chikuwabu, you can 
boil it for hours and hours,

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:33.570
and most of it will remain nothing 
but wheat flour mixed with water.

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:38.650
It gives off the superficial appearance 
of melting and integrating itself while,

00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:41.910
deep down, it rejects others and 
denies its wheat-based origins.

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:44.100
Uh, En-chan, do you hate chikuwabu?

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:45.900
I don't know if I hate it.

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:48.250
I just feel like I'm looking at an unknown lifeform.

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.830
But it's not a lifeform...

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.600
Where might this be?

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:01.060
A public bath... Why do you ask?

00:02:01.570 --> 00:02:03.020
What is a pub-lic-bath?

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:06.490
It's a place where you pay money
to sit in heated water,

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:09.480
to maintain bodily hygiene and relax the mind.

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:12.110
Relax the mind!

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:16.950
The people of this planet have an even 
more refined civilization than I thought!

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:21.870
How I should like to protect this planet...

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:23.340
R-Right...

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:26.360
Would you mind helping me?

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:29.290
Please!

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:32.250
Um... I'd just like...

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:33.710
to talk...

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:39.350
H-Hey! It stinks! It hurts! 
The fur's pricking me!

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:41.810
What is this thing? A bear? A dog? A pig?

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:44.950
Sirs! Please, no wrestling in the bath!

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:47.440
A wombat!

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:52.950
Diprotodontia Macropodidae!

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:54.590
Cousin to the koala!

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:57.520
They get sick if they get lonely
and have flat noses!

00:02:57.520 --> 00:03:00.150
There, there! Don't struggle!

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.780
Help me!

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.450
That kid is something else.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.960
Most people would run at the 
sight of a creature like that.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.510
And a pink one, no less.

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:14.940
He's a first year at our school. 
Hakone Yumoto, I think.

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:22.720
Heading home now?

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:26.990
The student council must have it rough.

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:30.070
And you must have it easy.

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:35.200
In oden terms, they're daikon radish, 
egg, and mochi-stuffed tofu.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.260
Is that a compliment?

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:39.100
A serious compliment. 
That's the golden trio, you know?

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:40.760
No konjac, huh?

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:44.120
Wait for me!

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:47.520
So what is he? In oden terms.

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:49.420
The pot, maybe?

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:50.960
That's not food...

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:53.600
Help!

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:54.980
Wait, I said!

00:03:57.190 --> 00:04:02.890
In the Name of Love

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:05.390
<b>Binan High School</b>

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:13.500
<i>My name is Chiku Kazutake.</i>

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:15.290
<b>Chiku Kazutake</b>

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:15.960
<i>I'm a student at Binan High School.</i>

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:19.780
<i>I have no strong subjects. 
No weak subjects, either.</i>

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:23.730
<i>I'm a member of the Biology Club, 
but I never actually attend.</i>

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:28.330
<i>My theory is that humans can be
 divided into three categories... I think.</i>

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:31.210
The beautiful Nozomi invited us to a mixer.

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:33.290
Sorry, my schedule's full already.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:37.980
<i>The beautiful, the ugly... 
and those who are neither.</i>

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:41.670
I'm going to be participating 
in the Math Olympics.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:43.220
I'm in the New Year's poetry reading!

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:47.680
<i>The smart, the stupid... 
and those who are neither.</i>

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:49.760
Ten more laps!

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:51.210
Okay! C'mon!

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:55.530
<i>The athletic, the frail... 
and those who are neither.</i>

00:04:57.470 --> 00:04:58.450
What?

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:00.110
I bumped into something.

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:03.940
<i>I'm... the third kind.</i>

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:06.780
<b>Class 3-C</b>

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:19.970
Stand!

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:23.880
Is that a pet?

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:24.590
A stuffed animal?

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:25.160
Isn't it huge?

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:25.780
It's giant!

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:26.800
Why'd he bring an animal here?

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:29.910
Hey, you think Tawarayama's 
finally... you know?

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:30.770
That, huh?

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:33.390
Finally losing his marbles?

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:35.300
Bow.

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:37.190
Take your seats.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:39.900
You boys are...

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.330
Did that voice come from the animal?

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:44.740
That wasn't Tawarayama's voice.

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:47.630
No. It is nothing.

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:50.310
We shall begin class now.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:51.940
"Shall"?

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:53.460
"Shall"?

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.240
En-chan...

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.630
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:02.940
Ah, begging your pardon, you two.

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.360
No, please, wait for me!

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:08.810
Won't you please hear me out?

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:10.510
Yeah, he's talking.

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:11.940
Oh, forgive me.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:15.090
Circumstances demand that 
I draw attention away from myself,

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:19.480
so I would appreciate it if you would act 
as if you're speaking to this individual.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.720
Little late for that!

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:24.510
But to meet you two again
like this must be destiny!

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:25.950
No, destiny has nothing to do with it.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:26.980
Please come with me!

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:27.760
Pass.

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:29.970
Do you mean "pass" as in "approved"?

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:31.770
Is that some old con man trick?

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:33.650
On Earth, it means "I refuse."

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:35.080
Wonderful!

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:39.370
Please, teach me everything there is 
to know about Earth culture and customs!

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:40.320
Too much responsibility!

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:42.390
Why don't you ask Mr. Tawarayama?

00:06:42.390 --> 00:06:46.630
Oh, no, you see, this individual has some 
difficulties with mobility and endurance...

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:47.900
That seemed vaguely insulting.

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:49.100
Wasn't he turning 77 this year?

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.250
No, that's not what I'm talking about.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:56.310
Setting that aside, I want us to protect this 
lovable Earth with the power of love together!

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:59.090
Why, you ask? I do it all for love!

00:06:59.090 --> 00:07:00.220
No, we didn't ask.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:01.940
Sorry, but we have other things to do.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:05.020
That's right! I need to meditate 
on the matter of chikuwabu!

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.550
Chikuwabu? What's that?

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:11.810
It's a thing that exists, yet does not exist! 
Like a symbol of uncertainty!

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:15.210
I'm trying to figure out the purpose
of chikuwabu's existence!

00:07:17.590 --> 00:07:20.620
Chikuwabu's... purpose?

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:24.830
So this is where you were!

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:27.530
What, are you trying to be 
Mr. Tawarayama's pet?

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:30.180
Using him as your hands?
 Going undercover? Want a rice ball?

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:34.470
Pardon me, but would you mind 
saving me from that threat?

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:35.470
Why?

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:39.370
I realize that he presents no hatred 
or malice, but instincts dictate...

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:41.020
I won't let you run again!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.670
I'll die if he gets near me!

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:47.550
Why? Why? I read on the net 
that wombats love rice balls!

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:48.690
I wanna cuddle you!

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:50.000
Pass!

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:52.090
That means "approved," right?

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:55.300
Are you okay?

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:56.600
Yes...

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.300
I don't know whether to call it 
a question or an opinion, but...

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:03.270
Those two really aren't on the 
same wavelength, are they?

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:04.640
Not a bit.

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:06.690
<b>Earth Defense Club                      (lol)</b>

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:08.750
Yo.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.460
Good day, Senpai.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.340
Io. How are you doing today?

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:15.730
Feeling like I just dropped a 
lump of butter into boiling oil.

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:16.790
And you, Ryuu?

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.390
Just perfect, by certain standards.

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:21.400
I melted off twenty million in twenty minutes.

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:24.360
I ended up triple-booked. 
I'm really in trouble.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.270
You guys amaze me.

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:27.470
Money is...

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:28.430
Women are...

00:08:28.430 --> 00:08:29.640
Life!

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:31.280
Oh, speaking of which,

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:33.300
I found this on the door.

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:33.740
Urgent
Please register your 
club officially. 
 -Student Council

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.640
A student council request for club registration?

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:41.940
In other words, if we want to use the room, 
we need to officially register as a club.

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:43.200
What a pain.

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:45.380
That's why I keep telling you

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:47.540
we should be the Innocent Co-Ed Mingle Club!

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:49.250
That violates public decency!

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:52.170
Then what about the 
Economics in Practice Club?

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:54.230
It's lacking in high school student character!

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:57.280
...is what the student council 
president would say, I expect.

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:58.780
Good point.

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:01.330
Why not just make it the Earth Defense Club?

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:03.860
Oh, that thing hanging on the door...

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:10.240
<b>Earth Defense Club                      (lol)</b>

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:07.170
The mystery sign that's been hanging 
there since who knows when, right?

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:08.520
Why not? This is a pain.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:10.230
We can't do that.

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:13.470
We've been buying time by
saying we'll submit it soon,

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:14.740
but this might be the limit.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.330
Clubs need at least five members.

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:17.950
We need an advisor, too.

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:23.370
Mr. Tawarayama?!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.790
Is he... dead?

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:32.060
The aftermath?

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:38.010
<b>Hakone Yumoto
Born January 26th
Blood Type O / Aquarius
Hobby: Exercise
Likes: Animals, rice balls</b>

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:55.820
The purpose of chikuwabu...

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:57.780
It has no purpose.

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.610
Chikuwabu could disappear 
and no one would care.

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:03.120
<i>That's right. And you could disappear, too...</i>

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:14.920
This is bliss.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.820
Cuddling really is great!

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:18.840
Are you Hakone Yumoto?

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:22.820
Yeah! Thanks for always 
usin' the Kurotama Bath!

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:24.430
Aren't animals awesome?

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:27.790
My cuddle battery's charged up 
for the first time in forever!

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:31.050
I think he really is dea—

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:31.810
Don't say it.

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:37.310
He came back to life?!

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:40.980
After all this, I won't 
ask any more of you boys!

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:43.740
On the contrary, I'm going to 
make you take responsibility!

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:45.760
Responsibility?

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:46.610
For what?

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:49.000
He's saying we can cuddle 
for the rest of our lives!

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:52.420
It'll take too long to explain, 
so I'll make it quick!

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:53.920
Lovracelet!

00:10:58.340 --> 00:10:59.470
What's this?

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.920
You're giving them to us? 
"The Wombat Returns"?

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:05.690
The Lovracelets are your love, given form!

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:08.160
Wombat's love given form?

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:09.850
Wait, what the hell is "love given form"?

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:12.930
It buzzed!

00:11:12.930 --> 00:11:14.500
Are these defective?

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:17.960
That's a problem. Should I contact the 
manufacturer and earn us a quick buck?

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:20.130
You're surprisingly unscrupulous.

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:22.240
They are not defective!

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:25.620
That's the Lovracelet's Love Alert!

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.160
Let's go!

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:30.510
It kindly lets you know immediately

00:11:30.510 --> 00:11:35.670
when the loveless are thinking loveless 
thoughts and taking loveless actions!

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.160
"Kindly" lets us know?

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:39.420
You're pretty smart for 
someone so fuzzy, Wombat.

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:44.430
Incidentally, I am not one of your 
Earth mammals known as the wombat.

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:45.840
What?!

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:48.550
No, I think it's weirder that 
you're surprised by that.

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:50.160
But he can speak our language!

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:52.900
No, I think that just makes it weirder.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:54.400
And he's pink, at that.

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:56.830
Don't worry about conversing.

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:59.730
I have a high-performance 
automatic translator.

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:01.160
That's an amazing thing to just blurt out.

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:04.910
My name is *$%@ and I come from &!@$.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:06.530
What? Say that again?

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:09.320
I am ^%@*# and I come from $!*@#.

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:10.730
Was it different that time?

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:11.720
It's %*@#$%!

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:14.640
Oh, forget it! We can just go with 
Wombat. Right, Wombat?

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:16.600
What's your deal, man?

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:18.800
Huh? Huh?

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:22.470
You got a problem with me? Huh? Huh?

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:24.140
What's that thing?

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:25.140
Chikuwabu.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.250
You said it!

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:28.850
But it's clearly chikuwabu!

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.410
The Chikawabu Monster?

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:32.900
You just casually named it.

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:34.740
Aren't you going to cuddle it?

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:36.870
Nah, that's a little out of my range.

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:38.480
You have a range?

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:41.440
What are you saying? Of course I do.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.900
Doesn't it look a little sticky?

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.800
Its surface does seem to be melting...

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:47.310
It's a little gross for me, too.

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:48.470
Is it?

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:51.570
Uh, I think the monster part is a bigger 
problem than the chikuwabu part...

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:52.870
That's right!

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:56.210
Now, you must "Love Making" 
into the Battle Lovers!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:58.170
Huh? Love Ma—

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:01.130
You, who befoul our beloved Earth!

00:13:01.770 --> 00:13:03.950
What are you saying, Yufuin-senpai?

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:06.100
"Beloved Earth"?

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:09.060
No justice can come from loveless power!

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:10.560
You, too?

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.480
Love is all!

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:15.930
Are you... being forced to say this?

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:17.900
Live for love! Die for love!

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:19.620
I get it!

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:23.610
Making us pose and say embarrassing lines 
is part of your mysterious power, right?

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:26.080
No, it is the power of love!

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:29.000
We are the heirs to the throne of love!

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.870
Battle Lovers!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:34.810
Love Making!

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:01.970
The Sparkling Prince!

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:03.800
Battle Lover Scarlet!

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.410
Love Making.

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:16.670
The Flashing Prince!

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:18.420
Battle Lover Cerulean!

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:21.070
Love Making!

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:30.890
The Piercing Prince!

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.900
Battle Lover Epinard!

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:35.620
Love Making.

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:45.580
The Roaring Prince!

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:47.570
Battle Lover Sulfur!

00:14:48.510 --> 00:14:50.010
Love Making!

00:14:58.550 --> 00:14:59.900
The Thrilling Prince!

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:01.970
Battle Lover Vesta!

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:04.220
Feel the power...

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.580
Of love!

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:10.310
What is all this?!

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:14.270
We look like some third-rate idol group.

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:17.410
I know. The needless exposure 
and mysterious ornamentations...

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:19.510
This is clearly beyond weird.

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:21.970
But it looks better on 
me than I was expecting!

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:23.090
I suppose it does.

00:15:23.090 --> 00:15:25.490
This will be trouble! 
I'll end up even more popular.

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.040
It won't come off!

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:27.920
Seriously?

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:29.440
Seriously!

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:31.560
What, we have to stay like this forever?!

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:33.110
Please, undo this!

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:35.280
It's a bit late to be saying that!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:38.880
You boys are the Battle Lovers 
who protect the Earth!

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:41.170
And what's this "Sparkling Prince" stuff?

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:44.380
I don't think it's quite right 
for me to call myself a prince.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:45.840
You seem overly self-conscious.

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:47.120
No matter.

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.840
You are the heirs to the throne of love,

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:52.810
so you have the right to call yourselves princes.

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:55.390
It's not about having the right...

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:57.740
First of all, we don't 
want to be heirs to that.

00:15:57.740 --> 00:15:59.090
What was that?!

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:01.430
I don't even know what 
the "throne of love" is.

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:02.930
I hope it's romantic love.

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:04.060
It's not.

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:06.520
I don't need love!

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:10.350
The Chikuwabu Monster has lost his temper!

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:11.730
He forced his way into the conversation!

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:15.490
Live and die for love? Hah!

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:17.700
Humans should all just die!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.540
Broth? Broth?!

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:24.550
No one needs daikon radish, egg,
 chikuwa, hanpen, or cabbage rolls!

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:27.510
I'm going to make a world of only chikuwabu!

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:28.880
Huh?!

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:32.090
Once I do, the world will be united!

00:16:38.860 --> 00:16:39.780
What is this?

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:42.350
This is your Love Making power!

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:46.380
It's a "love up" of your inner love!

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:47.740
Cool!

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:52.330
Bouncy! Bouncy! Bouncy! Bouncy!

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:54.280
You tried to destroy the people 
who live on this lovable Earth.

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:56.500
Go, and love even your enemies!

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:03.580
Love Stick!

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:08.100
Huh? Is this love or discipline?

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:10.530
Love, while gentle, is also harsh!

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:12.420
Can I shoot a beam with this? Can I?

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:14.420
Can I?!

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:16.640
I can!

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:17.340
Seriously?!

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:20.000
Love can go take a hike!

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:23.430
Yeah!

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:27.350
The Sparkling Prince is gonna 
sparkle your sparkles off!

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:36.970
It's incredible how quickly he adapts.

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:37.880
Yeah.

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:41.160
I don't like letting him 
get all the limelight.

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:43.200
Oh? You getting in the mood?

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.930
I could tell great stories about this later.

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:46.220
I'm going to join the fight!

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:49.660
Well, we may as well treat a farce as a farce...

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:51.250
...and just get it over with quickly.

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:52.110
Yeah.

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:03.060
Um, let's go with... Something-or-Other Storm!

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:05.110
What?!

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:07.440
It actually fired!

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:08.560
That was pretty random.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:11.020
Random Splash!

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:14.520
Then I'll join in.

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:16.450
Added Margin Bomber!

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:20.480
That's not fair! I got here first!

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:22.260
I Am Awesome Fire!

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:27.670
Five against one is cheating!

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:31.420
Yeah, right. You were the one 
saying all humans should die.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.140
You can't let five of them scare you.

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:35.460
Okay, let's go! Something-or-Other—

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:36.510
Pardon me.

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:40.340
Could you all please stop calling 
out random attack names?

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:45.200
In that case, our powers unite to...

00:18:56.690 --> 00:19:00.130
Love Attack!

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:14.960
Hey, Yumoto, that was overkill.

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:17.380
I don't need your pity.

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:21.510
Charity and comfort are useless to me.

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:24.980
That's convenient for an enemy to say.

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:28.320
Stop this! If you say any more, 
you'll raise a defeat flag!

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:31.730
We chikuwabu have a chikuwabu sort of pride!

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:34.870
Even if you won't acknowledge its existence,

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:37.290
I will continue to live on, as chikuwabu!

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:40.120
It's not that we don't acknowledge it...

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:42.650
If I have to choose one way or 
the other, I like chikuwabu.

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:44.580
Yeah.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:47.660
Some people have strange tastes. 
Good things will come your way someday.

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:50.250
That's not very convincing support.

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:52.230
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:54.590
I don't need your support!

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:56.780
Inconspicuousness is still a flavor!

00:19:56.780 --> 00:20:00.550
It beats ending up with a dubious status like 
burdock tempura or squid tentacle tempura!

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:01.800
Lay off, jerk!

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:06.210
Physical force?

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:08.190
What was the point of that 
finishing move earlier?

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:10.650
Listen, you need to wake up!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:14.010
Oden isn't complete with only one ingredient.

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:18.270
The popular trio of daikon radish, 
egg, and mochi-stuffed tofu,

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:19.680
the low-profile burdock tempura,

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:22.820
the amiable thick-fried tofu, 
the non-conforming cabbage rolls...

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:24.580
And chikuwabu!

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:27.540
When they all come together, 
that's what you call oden!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:30.300
The world, the Earth... It's all oden, too!

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:33.510
Oden is the Earth! You get it?

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:35.170
Uh-huh.

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:38.110
He kind of forced it all to fit together, huh?

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:41.290
I can't tell if that's too big or too small.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:46.500
Love Shower!

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:55.000
What is this mysterious sensation?

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:57.110
Comfort... Healing...

00:20:57.110 --> 00:21:00.320
I feel the universe soaking 
into me like a golden broth...

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:02.680
I see... So this is love...

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:09.290
Love is over!

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:10.750
No, it's not!

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:13.570
Huh? What was that guy's name?

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:15.010
From the class next to ours...

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:17.750
I remember. He's kinda low-profile, but...

00:21:18.230 --> 00:21:20.690
He looks clean and refreshed, 
like he just had a bath.

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:21.780
Yeah.

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:24.740
While we're the ones who are a total mess.

00:21:25.520 --> 00:21:26.480
I reek of broth!

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:29.080
When that happens, 
just hit up the Kurotama Bath!

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.380
I have coupons!

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:32.340
Oh, yeah!

00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:34.140
One for you, too!

00:21:34.950 --> 00:21:37.780
Yeah, let's do that. 
A hot bath after a bloodbath.

00:21:37.780 --> 00:21:39.010
Ugh, that pissed me off.

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:39.800
Me, too.

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:40.530
Totally.

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:42.190
I'll join you!

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:43.230
Come on over!

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:46.180
Say, why is Mr. Tawarayama 
carrying you everywhere?

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:47.680
If I get too far away from him...

00:21:50.850 --> 00:21:52.640
Just who are they?

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:56.670
Has someone appeared to try to defy us?

00:21:57.090 --> 00:22:00.050
No matter. This is well within our expectations.

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:03.690
Next time, the real battle will begin.

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:08.000
Prepare yourselves, Earth Conquest Club.

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:08.870
Yes, sir.

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:42.370
Before we even realized what was happening,

00:23:42.370 --> 00:23:44.860
we ended up protecting the Earth!

00:23:45.240 --> 00:23:50.480
But I don't mind joining the Battle Lovers 
if it means I get to cuddle Wombat!

00:23:50.480 --> 00:23:53.200
Next time: Love Means Never Feeling Regret.

00:23:51.550 --> 00:23:55.170
Next Time

00:23:51.550 --> 00:23:55.170
Love Means Never Feeling Regret

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:54.530
Love Making!
